{"total_count":4,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5460","id":5110483921,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs79BWjm","number":5460,"title":"[field] Sync controlled value changes with field state","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7205061925,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABrXSFJQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20field","name":"component: field","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the field component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-10T13:16:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T11:23:20Z","closed_at":"2026-08-13T11:23:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5460","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5460","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5460.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5460.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-13T11:23:20Z"},"body":"`Field.Control` was the only Field control that ignored controlled value changes. Switch, Checkbox, Checkbox Group, Radio Group, Select, Slider, Combobox, Number Field, and OTP Field all sync through `useValueChanged` already. `Field.Control` instead drove every field concern from the DOM change event, so a value set from code had no path at all.\n\nTwo bugs followed.\n\n**Dirty state never cleared for non-string values.** The dirty check compares the input's string value against a baseline captured from the `value` prop. With `value={5}` the baseline was the number `5`, so `\"5\" !== 5` held forever and `data-dirty` stayed set even after the user returned the field to its initial value. Array values failed the same way by reference. The control now registers the serialized value, so the baseline and the comparison agree.\n\n**Programmatic changes left the field stale.** Setting the value from code, such as a clear button or a form library reset, updated the input text but not filled, dirty, or validity, so a resolved error stayed visible and a pending async validator for the old value could still publish.\n\nThe fix gives each mode one owner instead of running two sync paths at once. `useValueChanged` owns the controlled path, `onChange` owns the uncontrolled path, and `onChange` returns early when controlled. `Field.Control` now has the same shape as its siblings, with the residual difference being the mount-time DOM read that its uncontrolled mode requires.\n\nTwo smaller fixes ride along:\n\n- `details.cancel()` in `onValueChange` now stops the internal handling. It was ignored.\n- A controlled value the consumer rejects or rewrites no longer reaches the field state, matching Combobox, Number Field and OTP Field.\n\n## Performance\n\nRenders per keystroke for a controlled input, counted in jsdom (mount, then four keystrokes):\n\n| Validation mode | Base | This PR | Number Field |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `onSubmit` | 1 per keystroke | 2 on the first, then 1 | 2 on the first, then 1 |\n| `onChange` | 1 per keystroke | 2 per keystroke | 2 per keystroke |\n\nMoving the work into a layout effect costs one extra render per keystroke in `onChange` mode. That is the cost every sibling control already pays, and `Field.Control` now matches Number Field exactly. The base column achieved one render by doing the work synchronously in the change handler, which is the second sync path this PR removes.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5460/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5115","id":4734442011,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7qFeHu","number":5115,"title":"[listbox] Create the Listbox component","user":{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak","html_url":"https://github.com/michaldudak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaldudak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10029177824,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACVckb4A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/poc","name":"poc","color":"805688","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10503066029,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACcggRrQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20listbox","name":"component: listbox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-24T11:38:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T08:37:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/5115","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5115","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5115.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/5115.patch","merged_at":null},"body":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/5115/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4972","id":4584511110,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7idcma","number":4972,"title":"[combobox] Fix autofill and selected state edge cases","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9169581687,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAACIoy2dw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20combobox","name":"component: combobox","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the combobox component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-03T23:47:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T03:45:30Z","closed_at":"2026-06-17T15:20:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4972","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4972","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4972.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4972.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-17T15:20:23Z"},"body":"Part of the Codex sweep. Ports the Select autofill and selected-state fixes (#4934) to Combobox, with the review findings from that port folded in.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Browser autofill matches an item's rendered label, not just its serialized value, so a primitive `value=\"US\">United States` autofills correctly. Works for inline children and the `items` prop.\n- Field state (dirty, validation, error clearing) runs through the shared `useValueChanged` effects and respects `onValueChange`/`onInputValueChange` cancellation. A canceled autofill, selection, or input change no longer touches field state, and a canceled single selection keeps the popup open.\n- Multiple mode clears `data-dirty` when the value returns to its initial set, comparing element-by-element with the item comparator instead of by array reference.\n- When the input is inside the popup, the trigger's `aria-controls` points at the dialog popup (a stable `${rootId}-popup` id shared by the popup and trigger) instead of the listbox.\n- `Combobox.Label` resolves to `Combobox.Label.State` in the generated docs.\n\n## Original findings addressed\n\n- Canceling a single-select item press still closed the popup; it now stays open, with a test.\n- The `${rootId}-popup` id was built in both the popup and the trigger; it's now one `getComboboxPopupId` helper, with the custom-id path covered.\n- The autofill `forceMounted` mount was sticky and ran for `multiple` and `none` modes that never match; it's now scoped to single-selection autofill.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4934","id":4539885828,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs7gNEBt","number":4934,"title":"[select] Fix autofill and selected state edge cases","user":{"login":"atomiks","id":22450188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDUwMTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22450188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks","html_url":"https://github.com/atomiks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atomiks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6619567417,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio6VOQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/component:%20select","name":"component: select","color":"ffffff","default":false,"description":"Changes related to the select component.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6619596510,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8G3g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20bug","name":"type: bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":"It doesn't behave as expected.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-28T11:06:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T13:47:53Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T13:47:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/4934","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4934","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4934.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4934.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T13:47:48Z"},"body":"Fixes several Select edge cases where displayed selection state, autofill matching, and locked interactions could drift from the current value.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Match Select autofill against rendered item text after value and label checks so primitive values like `CA` can accept browser-filled text like `Canada`.\n- Keep item `data-selected` tied to the current value when controlled value changes while the popup is open.\n- Keep Field filled state consistent with placeholder semantics for empty string values.\n- Ignore item commits when a controlled-open Select is disabled or read-only.\n- Keep scroll arrows mounted through transition status so ending styles can apply.\n- Add regression coverage for the fixed Select behaviors.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4934/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}